label s276
text On our days off, we spend time playing in the park after visiting Nagisa's parents.
label 313
text It's one of Ushio's favorite places to go.
text It's no surprise, since it's right in front of the home she lived in for so long.
text It must have a strong spot in her memories as a place where she spent time playing with Sanae-san and the old man.
text I look around to see lots of parents with children, just like me.
text But most are mothers.
text I greet them again and again, just like when I drop off and pick up Ushio from kindergarten.
text Of course, I don't have much to talk about with the housewives, so I'm not able to be a part of their gossip circles.
text After making the rounds saying hello, I put Ushio on a swing and give her a push from behind.
text Ushio's eyes move away from me and begin to look at a group of children playing together.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Hm? Do you want to play with them?
