music BGM08B.mp3
text Tomorrow is Health and Sports Day. Both Ushio and I have the day off.
text @[Tomoya]
text What do you want to do tomorrow, Ushio?
setvar strS[1001] = "CGUS19C"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGUS19C.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound PHE.aac
text @[Ushio]
text I want to play.
text @[Tomoya]
text Well, of course we're gonna play. The question is what it is you want to do.
text @[Tomoya]
text Do you want to go to the park again?
text @[Tomoya]
text But it's a holiday, after all. It'd be nice to do something special.
text Just then, the phone rings.
text @[Tomoya]
text Oh, the phone. One second, Ushio.
sound PHF.aac
text @[Ushio]
text Okay.
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text @[Tomoya]
text Yes, this is Okazaki.
sound PHG.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "Hello, Tomoya-san?"
text It's Sanae-san's voice.
sound PHH.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "This is Sanae. Good evening."
text @[Tomoya]
text Good evening.
sound PHI.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "I'm sorry to have to ask on such short notice, but do you have any plans tomorrow?"
text @[Tomoya]
text Oh, no. I was just talking to Ushio about what we were gonna do.
text Is she coming up with yet another plan?
text If that's the case, what perfect timing.
sound PHJ.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "In that case, I have a favor to ask."
text @[Tomoya]
text Yes, what is it?
text This is Sanae-san talking to me, after all. I'm sure she's going to suggest something amazing.
sound PHK.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "Do you remember how Ibuki-san had her little sister with her?"
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Little sister?
sound PHL.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "Fuko-chan."
text @[Tomoya]
text Oh, I do remember something small around her feet...
sound PHM.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "Yes. Fuko-chan says she wants to come to your house to play, Tomoya-san."
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Excuse me?
sound PHN.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "Her older sister, Kouko-san asked me if I could ask you..."
sound PHO.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "Would you play with her tomorrow?"
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Um.
sound PHP.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "Yes?"
text @[Tomoya]
text Why me?
sound PHQ.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "I think it's because... Fuko-chan took a liking to Ushio-chan."
text ...So I don't have anything to do with it.
sound PHR.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "It seems like a good opportunity for her to go out on her own too."
sound PHS.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "You know how Fuko-chan was in the hospital all of that time, and Kouko-san never left her side?"
sound PHT.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "Well since she said on her own that she wants to play with Ushio-chan, Kouko-san wants to make that happen."
sound PHU.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "And it also seems like Fuko-chan is very shy around strangers."
sound PHV.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "Which makes it really unusual for her to want to play at the home of someone who she just met."
sound PHW.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "She seems to be very interested in you too."
text ...I'm finding that hard to believe.
sound PHX.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "Will you please help us out, Tomoya-san?"
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text For a moment, I don't know how to reply... But I can't turn down a request by Sanae-san.
text @[Tomoya]
text Sure... That's fine.
sound PHY.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "Really? I'm glad to hear that."
sound PHZ.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "I knew you were a kind person, Tomoya-san."
sound PI0.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "Then I'll give Fuko-chan your address. I think she'll be by in the afternoon."
text @[Tomoya]
text All right.
sound PI1.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "Is it okay if I also give Kouko-san your home phone number?"
sound PI2.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "She said she wanted to thank you if you said yes."
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah, I don't mind.
sound PI3.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "Then I'll let her know."
text @[Tomoya]
text Thank you, please do.
sound PI4.aac
text @[Sanae]
text "Okay, have a nice holiday!"
text I hang up.
text I wonder how nice the holiday will really be.
text My impression of this Fuko girl isn't the best to begin with.
text I mean, she DID try to kidnap Ushio...
text @[Tomoya]
text Hey, Ushio.
